    "title": "Jean Marie King - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 days ago Jean Marie King (Green) passed away on September 9, 2025, at the age of 92, at her home in Junction City Kansas. Jean was born on March 13, 1933 in Macks Creek, Missouri, to Levi Green and Eda (Parks)Green. Jean married James Eslie King on August 4, 1951 in Evansville, Indiana while Jim was stationed at Camp Breckinridge, Kentucky. They shared 73 years together and were the parents of two sons. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
